message: >-
  Cite this software with the full commit you used. Cite a retrieved
  mathematical artifact separately using its own source identity and scope.
type: software
title: "Query: exact-source research lookup"
abstract: >-
  Read-only lookup of curated research source identities and local byte
  verification. This tool reports catalog metadata; it does not establish
  mathematical claims or determine scientific acceptance.
